the Fundamentals of
Data Science webinars.

01:01:03.540 --> 01:01:06.519
And until then, everyone, have a great weekend.

01:01:06.519 --> 01:01:08.650
And we look forward to seeing you again
soon.

01:01:08.650 --> 01:01:09.650
Thank you so much.

01:01:09.650 --> 01:01:10.650
And thank you, Gully.

